    "detailed_description": "On the 60th floor of a mysterious high-rise building, Yumi rides the elevator down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStrange people and animals enter the elevator.<br />\r\nVarious objects beyond the open doors.<br />\r\nMysterious phenomena....<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is up to you to find out what kind of consequences they will have for her.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYumi, who is scared, must be chanting in her mind.<br />\r\nDon't worry.<br />\r\nThere are no ghosts.<br />\r\nThere will never be any ghosts.......<br />\r\n<br />\r\n=====<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a click game with multiple endings and takes only a few minutes to play.<br />\r\nMany many different endings await you and Yumi.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStopping at a floor in the middle of the game?<br />\r\nDo you open the door on the floor where someone stopped you? Or refuse?<br />\r\nGet an item? Who will you use it on?<br />\r\n... and many other &quot;actions&quot; will lead you and Yumi to various outcomes.<br />\r\nThe game is also a puzzle solving game where you can buy &quot;hints&quot; for the ending you have not seen yet with the in-game coins, and compare them with the conditions of the ending you have already seen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill Yumi be able to reach the 1F... and her &quot;daily life&quot;?",
    "about_the_game": "On the 60th floor of a mysterious high-rise building, Yumi rides the elevator down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStrange people and animals enter the elevator.<br />\r\nVarious objects beyond the open doors.<br />\r\nMysterious phenomena....<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is up to you to find out what kind of consequences they will have for her.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYumi, who is scared, must be chanting in her mind.<br />\r\nDon't worry.<br />\r\nThere are no ghosts.<br />\r\nThere will never be any ghosts.......<br />\r\n<br />\r\n=====<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a click game with multiple endings and takes only a few minutes to play.<br />\r\nMany many different endings await you and Yumi.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStopping at a floor in the middle of the game?<br />\r\nDo you open the door on the floor where someone stopped you? Or refuse?<br />\r\nGet an item? Who will you use it on?<br />\r\n... and many other &quot;actions&quot; will lead you and Yumi to various outcomes.<br />\r\nThe game is also a puzzle solving game where you can buy &quot;hints&quot; for the ending you have not seen yet with the in-game coins, and compare them with the conditions of the ending you have already seen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill Yumi be able to reach the 1F... and her &quot;daily life&quot;?",
